### ===================================
### AI Call History API Tests
### Base Path: /api/ai/history
### ===================================

### Get History by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/1

###

### Get Current User's History (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get History - Page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Current User's Favorites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Current User's Archived History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/archived?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get History by Prompt Mode - Translation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/mode/directly-translation?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get History by Prompt Mode - Grammar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/mode/grammar-explanation?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Toggle Favorite Status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/1/favorite

###

### Archive History Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/1/archive

###

### Delete History (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/1
